    <briefdescription>
<para>Extracts plain-text legal clauses from a document. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Splits content at sentence and paragraph boundaries, filters tokens that are clearly tabular or citation-like, and assigns TEXT_CLAUSE modality. Each resulting sample represents a single legal clause or sentence that meets the minimum length threshold. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
